## Missions
cl.missao.condensador.titulo=Water in the desert
cl.missao.condensador.desc=Craft a Water Condenser (4 iron ingots, glass, a bucket and 3 cobblestone) and place it. Until then drink the jars from the chest, the water in the wrecks and cactus water (bowl + cactus, boil it in a furnace).
cl.missao.agua.titulo=First drop
cl.missao.agua.desc=Wait for the condenser to fill and collect a bucket of water.
cl.missao.muda.titulo=Roots
cl.missao.muda.desc=Place some of the dirt from the chest and plant an oak sapling on it. Bone meal helps it grow. Keep leaves and saplings: in a barrel they turn into dirt.
cl.missao.lenha.titulo=Firewood
cl.missao.lenha.desc=Break 4 oak logs.
cl.missao.bancada.titulo=Makeshift workshop
cl.missao.bancada.desc=Craft and place a crafting table.
cl.missao.picareta.titulo=Stone from the sieve
cl.missao.picareta.desc=There is no stone underground here: sieve dirt, turn 4 pebbles into 1 cobblestone and get 8. Dirt: craft a Wooden Barrel (6 planks + 1 oak slab) and fill it with 8 leaves or saplings (or 10 dead bushes, cacti or rotten flesh); in 1 minute it turns into 1 dirt. Minecraft tools are awful here: the good ones are the Tinkers tools.
cl.missao.forno.titulo=Fire
cl.missao.forno.desc=Craft and place a furnace (8 cobblestone from pebbles).
cl.missao.ferro.titulo=Metal
cl.missao.ferro.desc=No dirt needed: sieve sand (the whole ground is sand). 1 in 5 gives Crushed Iron Ore; 4 make 1 raw iron (at the table) and it smelts in the furnace. Get 3 ingots.
cl.vanilla.ruim=§cMinecraft tool:§r awful here (slow and wears 8× faster). Use the Tinkers tools.
cl.duas_versoes=§c[Pouso Forçado %s] This world has two versions of the add-on active at the same time.§r Leave without touching anything: edit the world and, in Behavior and Resource Packs, keep only the newest Pouso Forçado.
cl.missao.noite.titulo=Survive the night
cl.missao.noite.desc=Hold out until the next sunrise. Many monsters come at night: build a shelter.
cl.missao.cacador.titulo=Hunter
cl.missao.cacador.desc=Defeat 5 monsters.
cl.missao.trigo.titulo=First harvest
cl.missao.trigo.desc=Till soil next to water, plant the seeds and harvest 3 wheat.
cl.missao.papel.titulo=Paper for the logbook
cl.missao.papel.desc=Plant sugar cane next to water and craft 3 paper.

