cl.capitulo.nihilo.nome=From Nothing (Ex Nihilo)
cl.capitulo.nihilo.desc=Hammer, sieve, barrel and crucible: everything comes out of sand and dirt.
cl.missao.en_martelo.titulo=Hammer time
cl.missao.en_martelo.desc=Make a Hammer (2 materials + 2 sticks, as in Ex Nihilo) and break 16 blocks with it: cobblestone becomes gravel, gravel becomes sand, sand becomes dust.
cl.missao.en_poeira.titulo=Dust
cl.missao.en_poeira.desc=Collect 8 Dust blocks (sand broken with the hammer).
cl.missao.en_pedrinhas.titulo=Pebbles
cl.missao.en_pedrinhas.desc=Collect 8 pebbles: sift dirt or break stone with the hammer. 4 pebbles = 1 cobblestone.
cl.missao.en_minerio.titulo=Ore from nothing
cl.missao.en_minerio.desc=Sift gravel, sand or dust until you have 4 iron pieces and make 1 raw iron (4 pieces in a square).
cl.missao.en_barril.titulo=Barrel
cl.missao.en_barril.desc=Make and place a Wooden Barrel (6 planks and 1 wooden slab).
cl.missao.en_composto.titulo=Dirt in a barrel
cl.missao.en_composto.desc=Fill a barrel with scraps (saplings, leaves, rotten flesh, wheat...) and wait for it to turn into dirt.
cl.missao.en_argila.titulo=Clay
cl.missao.en_argila.desc=Put a water bucket in a barrel and tap it with Dust in hand: it becomes clay.
cl.missao.en_cadinho.titulo=Crucible
cl.missao.en_cadinho.desc=Porcelain = clay + bone meal. 7 porcelain make an Unfired Crucible; smelt it and place the Crucible on top of a heat source (torch, fire, lit furnace...).
cl.missao.en_lava.titulo=Lava
cl.missao.en_lava.desc=Melt 4 cobblestone in the crucible and take out 1 lava bucket.
cl.missao.en_obsidiana.titulo=Obsidian
cl.missao.en_obsidiana.desc=Lava in a Stone Barrel with a water block on top becomes obsidian. Take the obsidian out.
cl.missao.en_cajado.titulo=Crook
cl.missao.en_cajado.desc=Make a Crook (4 sticks shaped like a cane). Breaking leaves with it can drop a silkworm.
cl.missao.en_bicho.titulo=Silkworm
cl.missao.en_bicho.desc=Find a silkworm by breaking leaves with the crook (1 in 100).
cl.missao.en_linha.titulo=Silk farm
cl.missao.en_linha.desc=Use the silkworm on a leaf: it gets infested and spreads to its neighbours. Break infested leaves for string. Hand in 16 string.
