cl.capitulo.enviromine.nome=Climate and Hunger (EnviroMine)
cl.capitulo.enviromine.desc=65 °C sun, cold nights, salt water, bad air underground and food that barely fills you.
cl.missao.em_camel.titulo=Camel Pack
cl.missao.em_camel.desc=Make a Camel Pack (8 leather around a bottle) and wear it on your chest. It holds 4 bottles of clean water and lets you drink on its own.
cl.missao.em_encher.titulo=Full canteen
cl.missao.em_encher.desc=With the Camel Pack on your chest or in your offhand, sneak and use a Good Water to pour it in, or sneak and tap a water condenser with an empty hand.
cl.missao.ho_comer.titulo=Well fed
cl.missao.ho_comer.desc=Eat 5 meals that make you "Well Fed" (health comes back faster). Raw food barely fills: cook it.
cl.missao.em_filtros.titulo=Filters
cl.missao.em_filtros.desc=Make 4 Air Filters (iron + paper or wool + charcoal).
cl.missao.em_mascara.titulo=Gas mask
cl.missao.em_mascara.desc=Make a Gas Mask (5 iron, glass and 2 filters). It protects from bad air underground and from storm sand. Use a filter while wearing it to recharge.
cl.capitulo.harvestcraft.nome=Desert Kitchen (HarvestCraft)
cl.capitulo.harvestcraft.desc=Seeds from the sieve, slow crops and kitchen tools: every dish fills more than raw food.
cl.missao.hc_colher.titulo=First harvest
cl.missao.hc_colher.desc=Plant a seed from the sieve on farmland and tap it when it is ripe to harvest.
cl.missao.hc_colheita.titulo=Garden
cl.missao.hc_colheita.desc=Harvest 10 times. Wet farmland, light and the right biome speed it up; the Greenhouse helps a lot.
cl.missao.hc_panela.titulo=Pot
cl.missao.hc_panela.desc=Craft and place a Pot (4 bricks and 1 stick). Tap it to cook.
cl.missao.hc_sal.titulo=Salt
cl.missao.hc_sal.desc=Boil Salt Water in the Pot and gather 4 Salt.
cl.missao.hc_caldo.titulo=Stock
cl.missao.hc_caldo.desc=Make Stock in the Pot (bone and Good Water). It is the base of soups.
cl.missao.hc_pilao.titulo=Cornmeal
cl.missao.hc_pilao.desc=Craft a Mortar and Pestle and grind corn until you have 2 Cornmeal.
cl.missao.hc_tortilha.titulo=Tortillas
cl.missao.hc_tortilha.desc=In the Skillet, make 2 Tortillas (cornmeal and Good Water).
cl.missao.hc_suco.titulo=Cold juice
cl.missao.hc_suco.desc=Drink a Cactus Fruit Juice (Juicer). Quenches thirst and cools you down.
cl.missao.hc_sopa.titulo=Hot soup
cl.missao.hc_sopa.desc=Have a Tomato Soup (tomato and stock in the Pot).
cl.missao.hc_burrito.titulo=Burrito
cl.missao.hc_burrito.desc=Eat a Bean Burrito (beans, tortilla, rice and cheese in the Skillet).
cl.catalogo.comer=Eat (Hunger Overhaul)
cl.catalogo.fome=Gives %s hunger and %s saturation.
