cl.pw.livro=Powah!: generators (Furnator, Magmator, Thermo Generator, Solar Panel, Reactor), Cells and Cables in 7 tiers. The Energizing Orb with Rods around makes Energized Steel and crystals. Batteries charge in the Hopper (chest below) and the Transmitter (bound with the Card); the Discharger puts energy back in the network. Ender Cells and Gates link far networks on the same channel (same owner). An Aerial Pearl on a zombie becomes a Player Aerial Pearl; a Photoelectric Pane on an enderman becomes a Lens of Ender; a Binding Card on an enderman becomes dimensional.
