cl.livro.livro_materiais.1=Materials and You.

Every Tinker tool is made of parts, each part of a material. The head (first part) sets speed, damage and mining level; the handle multiplies durability; the binding (and the materials) give traits.

Start with the Stencil Table (patterns), the Part Builder (wood, stone, flint, bone parts...) and the Tool Station.
cl.livro.livro_materiais.2=Large tools (Sledge Hammer, Vein Hammer, Excavator, Broad Axe, Scythe, Cleaver) have 4 parts and need the Tinker's Anvil (3 iron blocks and 4 seared bricks).

Next pages: each material's durability, speed, damage, level and trait.
cl.livro.livro_fundicao_pequena.1=Puny Smelting.

The Seared Melter on top of a Heater melts one item at a time: fuel in the Heater (coal, coal block, blaze rod, lava bucket), items in the chest above the Melter or by tapping it.

The Faucet beside the Melter pours into the Casting Table (with a cast) or the Basin (block).
cl.livro.livro_fundicao_pequena.2=Casts: pour gold over a part, ingot or nugget on the Table. Sand cast: sand on the Table and tap with the part (single use).

Seared Brick: grout (clay, sand and gravel) in a furnace.

In the Melter ore doesn't double: use the Smeltery for that.
cl.livro.livro_fundicao_poderosa.1=Mighty Smelting.

3×3 floor of Seared Bricks, empty 3×3 inside and walls of seared blocks (bricks, glass, tank, drain, chute, the controller), up to 4 layers. At least one Tank with lava (tap with a lava bucket).

Tap the Controller to form it. Throw items inside: ore doubles.
cl.livro.livro_fundicao_poderosa.2=Alloys: fluids combine by themselves. Bronze (3 copper + 1 tin), Rose Gold, Amethyst Bronze, Pig Iron (iron + meat soup from animals inside + honey), Hepatizon, Manyullyn (3 cobalt + 1 debris), Queen's Slime, Slimesteel, Cinderslime, Knightslime, obsidian (water + lava).

Chute: the touching chest feeds it. Channel: the faucet fills several tables.

Composite: part on the Table + fluid = another material.
cl.livro.livro_geringoncas.1=Tinkers' Gadgetry.

EFLN (gunpowder + flint): explodes where it lands. Glow Ball (8 snowballs + glowstone dust): light where it lands. Slime Sling: launches you opposite to where you look (aim at the ground to go up). Punji Sticks (sugar cane): hurt whoever steps on them. Piggybackpack (saddle + sky slime): carry an animal with you.

Slime staffs (crystal + slime log): Sky (leap), Earth (shockwave), Ichor (fireball), Ender (teleport).
cl.livro.livro_geringoncas.2=Armor: Plate (the material and the Maille from chains), Traveler's (leather and copper), Slimesuit (boots bounce, Slimelytra glide). Shields in the offhand: sneak to block.

Longbow, Crossbow, Shuriken, Throwing Axe and Javelin.

Ancient tools (War Pick, Battlesign, Swasher, Minotaur Axe, Melting Pan): in the pyramid chests.
cl.livro.livro_fundicao_fantastica.1=Fantastic Foundry.

Like the Smeltery, but of scorched blocks (scorched brick: nether grout — soul sand, magma cream and gravel — in a furnace) with the Foundry Controller.

No alloys, but ores give byproducts: iron gives steel, gold gives cobalt, copper gives gold, osmium gives iron.

Scorched Alloyer: joins the fluids of adjacent Melters and makes alloys.
