lategameTips.17=Storage Barrels hold a lot of a single item.
lategameTips.18=In an AE network all items are stored together and the terminal finds any of them.
lategameTips.19=There is no air on the Moon: wear the Oxygen Mask and Oxygen Gear and carry full tanks. A light tank lasts almost 7 minutes.
lategameTips.20=The rocket lands on the Moon, but only lifts off from a 3×3 pad: bring 9 pads, a fuel loader and power.
lategameTips.21=The Mekanism paxel is a pickaxe, an axe and a shovel in one tool.
lategameTips.22=The Mekanism Wind Generator makes more power the higher it is.
lategameTips.23=Cooking Pot on top of fire or a Stove: tap with the ingredients and, when it is done, serve with a bowl.
lategameTips.24=Tap a ripe crop to harvest it: it replants itself (Quark).
lategameTips.25=Item Conduit: tap it so the core turns orange and it pulls items from the touching chest to the other chests on the network.
lategameTips.26=A Mekanism balloon used in the air makes you fall slowly for a minute.
lategameTips.27=Put a Waystone at each base: tapping one takes you to any other you have activated.
